## Verification

Prove claims with real commands: identify → run → read exit code → report. No "should work". After edits: `read_lints` on touched files; fix diagnostics. Commands + severity: [`quality-gates.md`](../../docs/infrastructure/quality-gates.md).

Non-trivial handoff → [`delivery-gate`](../../.agents/skills/delivery-gate/SKILL.md). Merge/ship → [`done-gate`](../../.agents/skills/done-gate/SKILL.md).

## Quality bar (short)

- Non-trivial → [`feature-delivery`](../../.agents/skills/feature-delivery/SKILL.md) before code.
- Scoring / win rules in deep `app/utils/game/`; thin pages and composables.
- Rubric, self-review, closure loop → [`quality-gates.md`](../../docs/infrastructure/quality-gates.md).

**Severity:** critical/high before handoff; medium → fix, ticket, or accept. `invariant` → Vitest. Improve-architecture off default path. Smallest safe PR scope; reuse before new abstractions.

## Debugging

No symptom-only fixes. Root cause → one hypothesis → smallest verify → single fix. Detail: [`.cursor/rules/debugging.mdc`](./debugging.mdc) · short form in [`quality-gates.md`](../../docs/infrastructure/quality-gates.md) § Debugging.

## Git / scope

Follow **Git and destructive operations** in `.cursor/rules/core.mdc` (no commit/push/destructive git without explicit user approval). Router: `.agents/README.md`.

**`gh`:** this repo is **ionescuig/score_slate**. Before PR/merge/`gh` API here, active account must be **ionescuig** (`gh auth switch -u ionescuig` if needed). Leave **gabriel-klarian** for Klarian / work repos.

## Testing / UI / docs

- Behaviour changes (stores, composables, utils, scoring): tests under `tests/` — see [`testing.md`](../../docs/infrastructure/testing.md).
- UI: Tailwind + existing components; landscape for dense grids; industrial/Impeccable when asked (or via done-gate).
- Browser: Playwright MCP when available; prefer running `http://localhost:3000`.
- Keep `docs/` in sync with non-trivial behaviour changes; product decisions in `docs/product/` when appropriate.
- Avoid new dependencies unless necessary.

## Open Brain (MCP `user-open-brain`)

Reminders only — not product source of truth (`docs/` + rules win).

| When                        | Tool                                                                                          |
| --------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Task start / planning       | `search_thoughts` (query + optional `topic`); `list_thoughts` for recent / person / type      |
| Need full body after search | `fetch` by id (`search` = thin compat id/title/url)                                           |
| User asks to remember       | `capture_thought` — **never automatic**; offer then wait                                      |
| Reality changed             | `supersede_thought` (prefer over silent re-capture)                                           |
| Hide outdated               | `archive_thought` (prefer over `delete_thought`; hard-delete only if user asks, e.g. secrets) |
| Overview                    | `thought_stats`                                                                               |

No secrets in captures.

